<h2>Simple Maintenance That Extends Roof Life</h2>
<ul class="checklist">
  <li>Keep gutters and valleys clear of leaves and cedar debris, especially in fall.</li>
  <li>Trim branches back several feet from the roof to prevent abrasion and limb strikes.</li>
  <li>Check ceilings and the attic for stains after big storms.</li>
  <li>Get a professional inspection after any storm with hail you can hear on the roof.</li>
